From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: iris: gen1收到固件看门狗中断后走系统错误恢复

gen1的响应处理没有看watchdog状态。固件的看门狗中断到来后，iris_hfi_isr_handler()
按设计不再打开中断，等系统错误处理去重启固件，可是gen1根本不会安排这个处理：
core->state留在INIT，中断一直关着，固件已经停了。之后每次suspend都报
“skip power collapse”和“failed to suspend”，新会话“session open failed”，全系统
硬解要到重启才恢复。解码服务反复崩溃时就可能走到这里。

按gen2的做法处理：看到watchdog就走系统错误路径，标记错误状态并安排
sys_error_handler重新加载固件。中断的开关计数不用改：iris_vpu_power_off()在
watchdog时已经不再多关一次，iris_vpu_power_on()的enable_irq()正好配平。

调试：HFI_CMD_SYS_TEST_SSR（0x10101）类型3可以让固件主动触发硬件看门狗。

---
 .../media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1_response.c  | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1_response.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1_response.c
index 314167f8e..e6c0e97d3 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1_response.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_gen1_response.c
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 #include "iris_instance.h"
 #include "iris_vdec.h"
 #include "iris_vpu_buffer.h"
+#include "iris_vpu_common.h"
 
 static void iris_hfi_gen1_read_changed_params(struct iris_inst *inst,
 					      struct hfi_msg_event_notify_pkt *pkt)
@@ -699,6 +700,15 @@ static void iris_hfi_gen1_flush_debug_queue(struct iris_core *core, u8 *packet)
 
 void iris_hfi_gen1_response_handler(struct iris_core *core)
 {
+	if (iris_vpu_watchdog(core, core->intr_status)) {
+		struct hfi_msg_event_notify_pkt pkt = {.event_id = HFI_EVENT_SYS_ERROR};
+
+		dev_err(core->dev, "cpu watchdog error received\n");
+		iris_hfi_gen1_sys_event_notify(core, &pkt);
+
+		return;
+	}
+
 	memset(core->response_packet, 0, sizeof(struct hfi_pkt_hdr));
 	while (!iris_hfi_queue_msg_read(core, core->response_packet)) {
 		iris_hfi_gen1_handle_response(core, core->response_packet);
